                            <p class="card-text lead text-muted">
                                Amanah Logistics is a full-stack logistics management platform developed to digitize and
                                automate last-mile delivery operations. The system enables businesses to manage orders,
                                assign riders, track deliveries in real time, and monitor operational performance
                                through a centralized administrative dashboard.
                                <br><br>
                                As Co-Founder and Lead Developer, I designed the platform architecture and implemented
                                core features including order management, rider dispatching, route tracking, customer
                                notifications, and business analytics. The project combines web, mobile, and cloud
                                technologies to create a scalable logistics ecosystem.
                            </p>

