                        <p class="card-text mt-3 text-muted">
                            BioScope is a gamified anatomy learning platform developed as a Final Year Project to make
                            human anatomy education more engaging and accessible. The application allows users to
                            explore detailed 3D anatomical models, interact with body systems, identify organs, and
                            reinforce their understanding through integrated learning activities and assessments.
                            <br><br>
                            Designed for students and self-learners, BioScope combines immersive visualization with
                            educational content to bridge the gap between traditional textbooks and interactive digital
                            learning.
                        </p>

                        <div class="mt-3">
                            <h6 class="fw-bold text-white mb-2">Features Highlight:</h6>
                            <ul class="text-muted ps-3 small">
                                <li>Fully interactive 3D anatomy models</li>
                                <li>Organ identification and exploration tools</li>
                                <li>Educational information panels and system descriptions</li>
                                <li>Quiz and assessment features for knowledge reinforcement</li>
                                <li>Intuitive navigation and user-centered interface</li>
                                <li>Built in Unity using C# and modern game development techniques</li>
                            </ul>
